WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.680
Hello everyone, I'm Aniket.

00:01.980 --> 00:04.900
I've been staying at FF21 for the last two months.

00:04.900 --> 00:06.300
It's been a great journey for me here.

00:09.620 --> 00:12.540
You also get North Indian food here,

00:12.540 --> 00:15.840
apart from idli, dosa, those things.

00:16.480 --> 00:18.280
The room is very aesthetic, I can say.

00:18.320 --> 00:19.980
I have seen other PGs as well.

00:20.180 --> 00:23.200
At FF21, you get that feeling here.

00:24.980 --> 00:26.120
Community events.

00:26.740 --> 00:29.100
Sometimes they do Independence Day.

00:29.620 --> 00:33.840
Sometimes we organise card games and all those things,

00:33.960 --> 00:35.020
which is very good.

00:37.800 --> 00:40.020
If you're looking for a nice PG

00:40.020 --> 00:44.880
in Bangalore, I'd recommend FF21 at the top of the list.
